  "details": "Avatar Statistics:\n\nHow many unique people take my avatar.\n\nHow many people blocked a person with my avatar.\n\nHow many people Hide a person with my avatar.\n\nHow many people Add to favorite my avatar.\n\nAlso, It would also be cool to make likes and dislikes on avatars, so that you can understand whether people like the avatar or not.\n\nThis function can also be done in safety, for example, if an avatar has more than 50 likes, then the person who set up their safety for 50 likes will see the avatar and if there are less than 50 likes, then they will not see\n\nThis would be super useful for avatar creators, and new users",
